  "definition": "Reimbursable Expenses for Department Assessors",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-11-23",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-C 300) #12065, eff 1-1-17; ss by #13291, eff 11-23-21",
